0  (18) Pileus dark red-brown at centre, much paler yellow-brown to yellow-red towards mar gin; lamellae pale cream-coloured; caulocystidia absent; pileipellis with well-developed Dryophila-structure; hyphae of trama not turning green in alkali; in deciduous woods {Fagus, Quercus), more rarely associated with Picea or Pinus 020404132450G. erythropus0
